        "observed": "Inspected complete 806×600 daylight exterior. Broad warm ochre pointed dome, turquoise patterned cylindrical drum and small bead finial; blue rectangular entrance front with a tall pointed recessed iwan and lower doorway. Neighboring two-storey arcades are separate context. Fine tilework, calligraphy, gardens, shop awnings, people and street furniture not copied."
