        "observed": "Inspected complete 960×1269 evening exterior from the square. Blue rectangular portal with nested pointed opening, broad shallow honeycomb vault, lower wooden door and pale base; warm pointed dome on blue drum behind. No minarets appear. Twilight lighting, reflections, fine floral/calligraphic patterns and surrounding shops are not copied."
